          "y": 851.0,
          "width": 870.0,
          "height": 136.0,
          "content": "Instructions, skills, tests and review around Codex, Cursor or another suitable harness. Agent permissions require enforced controls; instructions alone are not a security boundary. Human decisions remain at release and other agreed gates.",
